{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方第一块大号文字，首先注意到白色主句中的红色高亮“心里热了”“有劲头”，随后才可能扫到下方紫色和绿色文字。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"正在回想从前亲近的日子。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"心里发暖、重新有劲、带着希望。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他担心很久才能再次遇见亲近的人，以及后来逐渐接受现实、即使没有亲近的人也要好好生活、不委屈自己挽留别人。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"顶部主句较长，包含回忆、盼望、重新振作、不再与过去较劲等多个意思。\",\n    \"中下方紫色和绿色两块也有大字号、高亮色文字，形成一定的主视线竞争。\",\n    \"粉色小字连续排列多个音乐意象，第一眼不容易逐个辨认。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a55431d7-1e66-411f-b833-dc97627310bc", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T023446919614Z", "elapsed_seconds": 53.5, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:35:40.430103+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "99eefe30a76bb2451d5cf752479273bea1372f82ef5cf9dc22856f873abab452", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "